# First run: the guided sign-in is named, and the only control looks for the
# sign-in instead of taking an address that cannot sign in by itself.
expect Connect Wallabag
expect kobo connect readlater
expect-missing Add address
clean
shot readlater-setup
tap Check again
wait-for No sign-in has arrived
expect-missing Off the air
clean
shot readlater-check-again
